Short:        A simple 68000 disassembler.
Author:       Bill Rogers
Architecture: m68k-amigaos
Source:       Fish collection

A simple 68000 disassembler.  Reads standard Amiga object files and
disassembles the code sections.  Data sections are dumped in hex.  The
actual disassember routines are set up to be callable from a user program
so instructions in memory can be disassembled dynamically.  
